# ==============================================================================
# SYNAPSE MATRIX HOMESERVER CONFIGURATION [EXPERIMENTAL]
# ==============================================================================
# Matrix homeserver — powers the razzfazz.ai internal Matrix network.
# Used by Moltis (bot account) and Element Web (browser client).
# Upstream: https://github.com/element-hq/synapse (AGPL-3.0)
# Note: SYNAPSE_SERVER_NAME is PERMANENT — cannot change after first start.
#       Sets Matrix user IDs to @username:${MAIN_DOMAIN}.
